# TBH HUD — improvement.log
Updated 2026-06-10 (cowork). Read-only companion for "TBH: Task Bar Hero" (v1.00.11).
Repo: revenantcabal-rgb/taskbarheroburat. Source of truth for detail: CLAUDE.md, docs/PRD.md, docs/PROGRESS.md.

## WHERE WE ARE (verified vs repo + live save — not claimed)
~23 commits. Read-only, calibrated, shippable. All 7 tabs render vs the live save with 0 console errors.
- Phase 2 — full game art: 535 item icons + 39 rune icons; 100% of owned items resolve a real icon.
- Phase 3 — premium dashboard: Overview / Party / Inventory / Loot / Runes / Lifetime / Trends. Animated hero GIFs,
  rarity-framed icon grid + enchant pips + tooltips (inherent gear stats + unique mods), per-hero gear + skill chips.
- Authoritative DB (NO guessing) from the game's own CSV TextAssets, built by scripts/build_gamedata.py ->
  src/engine/gamedata.min.json: 5944 items, 5440 gear, 62 stats, 36 skills, 6 heroes (+base stats), 132 attributes,
  108 passives, 8 pets, 61 monsters, 197 runes. en-US localization at src/engine/localization.min.json.
- Phase 5 — Player.log loot: Steam boxes held (real names), offline-reward gold (real timestamps), save-diff drop
  timeline (timestamped). Rare-drop alerts: Legendary+ ★ highlight + opt-in silent desktop Notification (OFF by default).
- Phase 6 — History/Trends: charts lifetime gold/kills/max-stage + gold/hr-by-interval from the game's own backups
  (browser Connect-folder dir picker + Electron backup IPC).
- #2 DONE — full "who's carrying" source breakdown on Party: per deployed hero, factual stat contributions by source
  (Base HeroInfoData / Gear inherent+enchants / Tree leveled passives + active skills) + account-wide runes & pet.
  Labeled gear/build power, NOT live DPS. No fabricated composite %.
- #3 DONE — loot & lifetime depth: active-pet card (PetInfoData, e.g. Dragon), rare-drop alerts, and a calibrated
  "Kills by monster" breakdown on Lifetime (aggregate Type-0 sub-counters = per-MonsterKey kills; VALIDATED: they sum
  EXACTLY to total kills, 26 types e.g. Orc 7683 / Slime 7532, 0 unnamed).
- Read-only re-audited: zero writes/injection to game/save/memory. verify_save.js passes (0 unresolved names, 100% icons).

